1
00:00:00,057 --> 00:00:02,847
I'm invoking our Body Snatchers clause.

2
00:00:03,018 --> 00:00:06,398
The Body Snatchers clause requires me
to help destroy someone we know...

3
00:00:06,563 --> 00:00:08,483
(Leonard:)...who's been replaced with an alien pod.

4
00:00:08,648 --> 00:00:11,608
(Sheldon:)Yes. She's in the living room.
Go. I'll wait here.

5
00:00:12,069 --> 00:00:16,449
- Sheldon, what are you doing out of bed?
- Now. Do it.

6
00:00:18,825 --> 00:00:22,495
You need your sleep for your cognitive
processing to perform at optimum levels.

7
00:00:22,662 --> 00:00:25,752
(Ramona:)- Now, come on.
- Godzilla clause?

8
00:00:25,916 --> 00:00:28,796
LEONARD:
Not unless she destroys Tokyo.

9
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:30,710
SHELDON:
Rats.

10
00:00:32,214 --> 00:00:33,504
SHELDON:
I've got it!

11
00:00:33,673 --> 00:00:36,463
(Sheldon(excitedly):)I finally reconciled
the black hole information paradox...

12
00:00:36,635 --> 00:00:39,305
(Sheldon(excitedly):)...with my theory
of string-network condensates.

13
00:00:39,471 --> 00:00:44,061
- It's unbelievable. It's paradigm-altering.
- And I could not have done it without you.

14
00:00:44,226 --> 00:00:47,686
(Ramona:)- I just offered a little encouragement.
- You did a lot more than that.

15
00:00:47,854 --> 00:00:50,314
(Sheldon:)You helped me work out
the masses of the fermions...

16
00:00:50,482 --> 00:00:52,062
...and you pumiced my hammertoe.

17
00:00:54,027 --> 00:00:55,407
(Sheldon:)How can I ever repay you?

18
00:00:55,570 --> 00:00:59,020
(Ramona:)Well, would you consider naming it
the Cooper-Nowitzki Theorem?

